      "description": "Start date: 2026-08-25\nPosted: Posted 10 Days Ago\nPart time\n\nJOB TITLE Temporary Research Aide LOCATION Worcester DEPARTMENT NAME Biomedical Engineering - JM DIVISION NAME Worcester Polytechnic Institute - WPI JOB DESCRIPTION SUMMARY The Research Aide will support ongoing research projects involving clinical ECG data. JOB DESCRIPTION Responsibilities will include data cleaning, organization, labeling, quality control, and testing of ECG datasets, as well as maintaining accurate documentation of data processing procedures and results. The Research Aide will also assist with basic data analysis, statistical analysis, and other research-related tasks as needed to support the timely completion of project milestones. All work involving clinical data will be performed in accordance with applicable research protocols and data confidentiality requirements. Hourly pay rate is $20 per hour. This is a temporary 25 hour per week position. FLSA STATUS United States of America (Non-Exempt) WPI is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, age, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or disability. It seeks individuals from all backgrounds and experiences who will contribute to a culture of creativity, collaboration, inclusion, problem solving, innovation, high performance, and change making. It is committed to maintaining a campus environment free of harassment and discrimination."
